%description:
Tests the decode of the ACE field with the AccECN option (RFC 9768 Appendix
A.2.2). The tester marks A030 CE and removes the ACKs B015 to B018, so B019
acknowledges 10 packets with one more CE mark in the ACE field. 10 packets could
hide a full cycle of the 3-bit field, which would be 9 marks (dSafer.cep), but
the ECEB field shows 1024 new CE bytes, less than half an MSS for each of 9
packets, so the sender takes 1 mark, as Linux does.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 40000"
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "accecn"
*.tcptester.script="a30 ce; b15 delete; b16 delete; b17 delete; b18 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.431 B015] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 26613 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP NOP AccECN0(e0b=26613)# deleting
[1.431 B016] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N ack 28661 win 16384   Option(s): AccECN0(e0b=27637,ceb=1024)# deleting
[1.431 B017] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N ack 30709 win 16384   Option(s): AccECN0(e0b=29685,ceb=1024)# deleting
[1.431 B018] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N ack 32757 win 16384   Option(s): AccECN0(e0b=31733,ceb=1024)# deleting
[1.431 B019] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N ack 34805 win 16384   Option(s): AccECN0(e0b=33781,ceb=1024)
[1.431 B020] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N ack 36853 win 16384   Option(s): AccECN0(e0b=35829,ceb=1024)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
AccECN option: delivered bytes ECT(0)=33780, CE=1024, ECT(1)=0
[]: AccECN: ACE=6, packets acknowledged=10, new CE marks=1 (mod 8: 1)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
